product-rating (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First released version. Versions follow semantic versioning; the entry
    here has to match the version in package.json, which build-deb.sh reads.
  * The application now sets its own hardening headers, including the
    Content-Security-Policy. The shipped proxy examples only add HSTS.
  * No change to the installation layout, the configuration or the database
    schema compared to 0.0.0.

 -- roemer2201 <roemer2201@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

product-rating (0.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging (M11). Installs the API server and the built web
    client below /opt/product-rating, served by one process.
  * Adds a hardened systemd unit, a logrotate rule and the
    /usr/bin/product-rating wrapper for serve, migrate and fsck.
  * postinst creates the system user, the data directories and the session
    secret and applies the database migrations; purge asks before it
    removes the database and the photos.

 -- roemer2201 <roemer2201@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
